            "content": "$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\Phi(x)=\\frac{1}{2}\\left[2 x^2+6 x-3-\\left(2 x^2-6 x-3\\right)\\right]=\\frac{1}{2} \\times 12 x=6 x . \\\\\n& \\text { 则 } \\Phi(-x)=6 \\times(-x)=-6 x=-\\Phi(x) .\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n所以应为奇函数,"
