            "content": "原式 $=\\lim _{n \\rightarrow \\infty} \\frac{\\left(1+\\frac{2}{n}\\right)^3+\\left(2+\\frac{3}{n}\\right)^3}{\\left(1-\\frac{1}{n}\\right)\\left(2-\\frac{1}{n}\\right)\\left(3-\\frac{2}{n}\\right)}=\\frac{3}{2}$"
