            "content": "设 $\\sqrt[3]{x}=t$, 则原式 $=\\lim _{t \\rightarrow 1} \\frac{t^2-2 t+1}{\\left(t^3-1\\right)^2}=\\lim _{t \\rightarrow 1} \\frac{1}{\\left(t^2+t+1\\right)^2}=\\frac{1}{9}$"
