            "id": "block-10-45-sol",
            "type": "text",
            "content": "由 $a_n-a_{n-1}=4 n-\\frac{5}{2}-\\left[4(n-1)-\\frac{5}{2}\\right]=4$ 知该数列为等差数列，$a_1=4-\\frac{5}{2}=\\frac{3}{2}$，\n又 $S_n=n a_1+\\frac{n(n-1)}{2} d=2 n^2-\\frac{1}{2} n=a n^2+b n$，得 $\\begin{cases} a=2 \\\\ b=-\\frac{1}{2} \\end{cases}$，\n故 $\\lim _{n \\rightarrow \\infty} \\frac{a^n-b^n}{a^n+b^n}=\\lim _{n \\rightarrow \\infty} \\frac{2^n-\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^n}{2^n+\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^n}=1$."
