        "solutionBlocks": [
          {
            "id": "block-10-47-sol",
            "type": "text",
            "content": "记 $S_n = (1+a)\\left(1+a^2\\right)\\left(1+a^4\\right) \\cdots\\left(1+a^{2^n}\\right)$，\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nS_n &= \\frac{1}{1-a}\\left[(1-a)(1+a)\\left(1+a^2\\right)\\left(1+a^4\\right) \\cdots\\left(1+a^{2^n}\\right)\\right] \\\\\n&= \\frac{1}{1-a}\\left[\\left(1-a^2\\right)\\left(1+a^2\\right)\\left(1+a^4\\right) \\cdots\\left(1+a^{2^n}\\right)\\right] \\\\\n&= \\frac{1}{1-a}\\left[\\left(1-a^4\\right) \\cdots\\left(1+a^{2^n}\\right)\\right] \\\\\n&= \\cdots \\\\\n&= \\frac{1}{1-a} \\cdot\\left(1-a^{2^{n+1}}\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n因为 $|a|<1$，所以 $\\lim_{n \\to \\infty} a^{2^{n+1}} = 0$。\n故原式 $= \\lim_{n \\to \\infty} S_n = \\frac{1}{1-a}$。"
          }
        ]
