            "type": "text",
            "content": "$\\lim _{x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{x-\\sin x}{x+\\sin x}=\\lim _{x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{1-\\frac{\\sin x}{x}}{1+\\frac{\\sin x}{x}}=\\frac{1-1}{1+1}=0$."
