            "id": "block-15-8-sol",
            "type": "text",
            "content": "$\\begin{aligned} & \\lim _{x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{\\sqrt{1+\\tan x}-\\sqrt{1+\\sin x}}{x(1-\\cos x)}=\\lim _{x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{\\tan x-\\sin x}{(\\sqrt{1+\\tan x}+\\sqrt{1+\\sin x}) x(1-\\cos x)} \\\\ & =\\frac{1}{2} \\lim _{x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{\\tan x(1-\\cos x)}{x(1-\\cos x)}=\\frac{1}{2} \\lim _{x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{1}{\\cos x} \\frac{\\sin x}{x}=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}$"
