          "$\\lim _{x \\rightarrow \\infty}\\left(1+\\frac{1}{x}\\right)^{-x}=0$",
          "$\\lim _{x \\rightarrow \\infty}\\left(1-\\frac{1}{x}\\right)^x=e^{-1}$"
