        "correctOption": 2,
        "choiceType": "single",
        "hintBlocks": [],
        "solutionBlocks": [
          {
            "id": "block-19-12-sol",
            "type": "text",
            "content": "要使 $f(x)$ 在 $x=0$ 处连续，需满足 $\\lim\\limits_{x \\to 0} f(x) = f(0) = a$。\\\\\n$\\lim\\limits_{x \\to 0} f(x) = \\lim\\limits_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\cos x^2}}{1-\\cos x}$，\\\\\n当 $x \\to 0$ 时，$1-\\cos x \\sim \\frac{1}{2} x^2$，$1-\\cos x^2 \\sim \\frac{1}{2} (x^2)^2 = \\frac{1}{2} x^4$，\\\\\n则 $\\lim\\limits_{x \\to 0} f(x) = \\lim\\limits_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{2} x^4}}{\\frac{1}{2} x^2} = \\lim\\limits_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} x^2}{\\frac{1}{2} x^2} = \\sqrt{2}$。\\\\\n所以 $a=\\sqrt{2}$。"
          }
        ]
