            "content": "$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& f(x)=\\lim _{n \\rightarrow \\infty} \\frac{x^{2 n+1}+a x^2+b x}{x^{2 n}+1}=\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}\nx,|x|>1 \\\\\n\\frac{1+a+b}{2}, x=1 \\\\\na x^2+b x,|x|<1 \\\\\n\\frac{-1+a-b}{2}, x=-1\n\\end{array}\\right. \\\\\n& \\lim _{x \\rightarrow 1^{+}} f(x)=1=f(1)=\\frac{1+a+b}{2}=\\lim _{x \\rightarrow 1^{-}} f(x)=a+b \\\\\n& \\lim _{x \\rightarrow-1^{-}} f(x)=-1=f(-1)=\\frac{-1+a-b}{2}=\\lim _{x \\rightarrow-1^{+}} f(x)=a-b\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n从而 $a=0, b=1$ 。"
