            "content": "$\\lim_{x \\to 0^+} f(x) = \\lim_{x \\to 0^+} (1+\\sin x)^{\\frac{1}{\\sin 2 x}} = \\lim_{x \\to 0^+} e^{\\frac{\\ln (1+\\sin x)}{\\sin 2 x}} = e^{\\frac{1}{2}}$，\n$\\lim_{x \\to 0^-} f(x) = \\lim_{x \\to 0^-} (1-\\tan x)^{\\frac{1}{\\ln (1-2 x)}} = \\lim_{x \\to 0^-} e^{\\frac{\\ln (1-\\tan x)}{\\ln (1-2 x)}} = e^{\\frac{1}{2}}$。\n因为 $\\lim_{x \\to 0} f(x) = f(0) = e^{\\frac{1}{2}}$，故 $x=0$ 是连续点。"
