            "content": "$\\begin{aligned} & \\lim _{x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{1}{x^3}\\left[\\left(\\frac{2+\\cos x}{3}\\right)^x-1\\right]=\\lim _{x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{e^{x \\ln \\frac{2+\\cos x}{3}}-1}{x^3}=\\lim _{x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{x \\ln \\frac{2+\\cos x}{3}}{x^3} \\\\ & =\\lim _{x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{\\ln \\left(1+\\frac{\\cos x-1}{3}\\right)}{x^2}=\\lim _{x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{\\cos x-1}{3 x^2}=-\\frac{1}{6}\\end{aligned}$"
