            "content": "解答 $\\lim _{x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{f\\left(x_0\\right)-f\\left(x_0+2 x\\right)}{6 x}=-\\frac{1}{3} \\lim _{x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{f\\left(x_0\\right)-f\\left(x_0+2 x\\right)}{-2 x}=-\\frac{1}{3} f^{\\prime}\\left(x_0\\right)=3$,所以 $f^{\\prime}\\left(x_0\\right)=-9$, 即 $\\left.d y\\right|_{x=x_0}=-9 d x$."
