            "content": "解答. 由题意得 $\\lim _{\\Delta x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{f\\left(x_0+\\Delta x\\right)-f\\left(x_0\\right)}{\\sin (3 \\Delta x)}=\\lim _{\\Delta x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{f\\left(x_0+\\Delta x\\right)-f\\left(x_0\\right)}{3 \\Delta x}=1$, 所以\n$$\nf^{\\prime}\\left(x_0\\right)=\\lim _{\\Delta x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{f\\left(x_0+\\Delta x\\right)-f\\left(x_0\\right)}{\\Delta x}=3 \\lim _{\\Delta x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{f\\left(x_0+\\Delta x\\right)-f\\left(x_0\\right)}{3 \\Delta x}=3 .\n$$"
