            "content": "设 $f(x)=\\left\\{\\begin{array}{ll}\\ln (x+1), & x \\geq 0, \\\\ 0, & x<0,\\end{array}\\right.$ 则右导数 $f_{+}^{\\prime}(0)=[\\quad]$."
