            "id": "block-33-7-sol",
            "type": "text",
            "content": "解答 在原方程中令 $t=\\frac{1}{x}$, 得 $f\\left(\\frac{1}{t}\\right)+2 f(t)=3 t$, 由 $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}f(x)+2 f\\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right)=\\frac{3}{x} \\\\ f\\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right)+2 f(x)=3 x\\end{array}\\right.$, 得 $f(x)=2 x-\\frac{1}{x}$, 所以 $f^{\\prime}(x)=2+\\frac{1}{x^2}$."
