            "content": "解答\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ny^{\\prime} & =f^{\\prime}(\\sin x \\cos x) \\cdot(\\sin x \\cos x)^{\\prime} \\\\\n& =f^{\\prime}(\\sin x \\cos x) \\cdot\\left(\\cos ^2 x-\\sin ^2 x\\right) \\\\\n& =f^{\\prime}(\\sin x \\cos x) \\cdot \\cos 2 x\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"
