            "id": "block-34-4-sol",
            "type": "text",
            "content": "解答 当 $x<1$ 时, $f(x)=\\ln |x-1|=\\ln (1-x)$, 则 $f^{\\prime}(x)=\\frac{1}{x-1}$,当 $x>1$ 时, $f(x)=\\ln |x-1|=\\ln (x-1)$, 则 $f^{\\prime}(x)=\\frac{1}{x-1}$."
