            "id": "block-36-2-q",
            "type": "text",
            "content": "设 $f(x)=\\left\\{\\begin{array}{cc}a x^2+b x+c, & x<0, \\\\ \\ln (1+x), & x \\geq 0,\\end{array}\\right.$ 若 $f^{\\prime \\prime}(0)$ 存在, 则 $a, b, c$ 的取值为 $[\\quad]$."
