          {
            "id": "block-36-8-sol",
            "type": "text",
            "content": "解答 当 $x=0$ 时, 代入原方程得 $y=0$.\n对方程两端关于 $x$ 求导, 得\n$$\n\\mathrm{e}^{x+y}\\left(1+y^{\\prime}\\right)-y-x y^{\\prime}=0,\n$$\n\n即\n$$\n(x y+1)\\left(1+y^{\\prime}\\right)-y-x y^{\\prime}=0\n$$\n\n合并整理得 $y^{\\prime}=\\frac{-\\mathrm{e}^{x+y}+y}{\\mathrm{e}^{x+y}-x}=\\frac{-(x y+1)+y}{x y+1-x}, y^{\\prime}(0)=-1$;\n对上式关于 $x$ 再求导, 得 $y^{\\prime \\prime}=\\frac{2 y^{\\prime}-\\left(y+x y^{\\prime}\\right)\\left(1+y^{\\prime}\\right)}{x y+1-x}, y^{\\prime \\prime}(0)=-2$."
          }
