            "content": "解答 两边取对数, 得 $\\frac{1}{x} \\ln y=\\frac{1}{y} \\ln x$, 即 $y \\ln y=x \\ln x$.\n两边对 $x$ 求导得\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}\n(1+\\ln y) y^{\\prime}=\\ln x+1, \\quad y^{\\prime}=\\frac{\\ln x+1}{1+\\ln y}, \\\\\ny^{\\prime \\prime}=\\frac{\\frac{1}{x}(\\ln y+1)-(\\ln x+1) \\frac{1}{y} \\cdot y^{\\prime}}{(1+\\ln y)^2}=\\frac{y(\\ln y+1)^2-x(\\ln x+1)^2}{x y(\\ln y+1)^3} .\n\\end{gathered}\n$$"
