            "content": "函数即 $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}x=\\frac{1}{2} \\ln \\left(1+\\sin ^2 t\\right) \\\\ y=\\cos 2 t\\end{array}\\right.$,\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\frac{\\mathrm{d} y}{\\mathrm{d} x}=\\frac{-2 \\sin 2 t}{\\frac{1}{2} \\cdot \\frac{1}{1+\\sin ^2 t} \\cdot 2 \\sin t \\cdot \\cos t}=-4\\left(1+\\sin ^2 t\\right) \\\\\n& \\frac{\\mathrm{d}^2 y}{\\mathrm{d} x^2}=\\frac{-4 \\cdot(0+2 \\sin t \\cos t)}{\\frac{1}{2} \\cdot \\frac{1}{1+\\sin ^2 t} \\cdot 2 \\sin t \\cdot \\cos t}=-8\\left(1+\\sin ^2 t\\right) .\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"
