        "choiceType": "single",
        "hintBlocks": [],
        "solutionBlocks": [
          {
            "id": "block-36-31-sol",
            "type": "text",
            "content": "解答 由 $\\frac{\\mathrm{d} y}{\\mathrm{d} t}=\\frac{-e^y}{1+t e^y}, \\frac{\\mathrm{d} x}{\\mathrm{d} t}=-2$,\n故 $\\frac{\\mathrm{d} y}{\\mathrm{d} x}=\\frac{e^y}{2\\left(1+t e^y\\right)}$,\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\frac{\\mathrm{d}\\left(\\frac{\\mathrm{d} y}{\\mathrm{d} x}\\right)}{\\mathrm{d} t}=\\frac{1}{2} \\cdot \\frac{e^y \\cdot \\frac{\\mathrm{d} y}{\\mathrm{d} t} \\cdot\\left(1+t e^y\\right)-e^y \\cdot\\left(e^y+t e^y \\cdot \\frac{\\mathrm{d} y}{\\mathrm{d} t}\\right)}{\\left(1+t e^y\\right)^2} \\\\\n& \\frac{\\mathrm{d}^2 y}{\\mathrm{d} x^2}=\\left(-\\frac{1}{4}\\right) \\cdot \\frac{e^y \\cdot \\frac{\\mathrm{d} y}{\\mathrm{d} t} \\cdot\\left(1+t e^y\\right)-e^y \\cdot\\left(e^y+t e^y \\cdot \\frac{\\mathrm{d} y}{\\mathrm{d} t}\\right)}{\\left(1+t e^y\\right)^2}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n代入 $t=0, x=y=-1$, 得\n$$\n\\left.\\frac{\\mathrm{d} y}{\\mathrm{d} t}\\right|_{t=0}=-\\frac{1}{e},\\quad \\left.\\frac{\\mathrm{d} y}{\\mathrm{d} x}\\right|_{t=0}=\\frac{1}{2 e},\\quad \\left.\\frac{\\mathrm{d}^2 y}{\\mathrm{d} x^2}\\right|_{t=0}=\\frac{1}{2 e^2}\n$$"
          }
        ]
