        "choiceType": "single",
        "hintBlocks": [],
        "solutionBlocks": [
          {
            "id": "block-36-33-sol",
            "type": "text",
            "content": "解答 注意到 $x=\\ln \\sqrt{1+t^2}=\\frac{1}{2} \\ln \\left(1+t^2\\right)$, 于是,\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\frac{\\mathrm{d} y}{\\mathrm{d} x}=\\frac{\\mathrm{d} \\arctan t}{\\mathrm{d} \\ln \\sqrt{1+t^2}}=\\frac{\\frac{1}{1+t^2} \\mathrm{d} t}{\\frac{1}{2} \\cdot \\frac{1}{1+t^2} \\cdot 2 t \\mathrm{d} t}=\\frac{1}{t} \\\\\n& \\frac{\\mathrm{d}^2 y}{\\mathrm{d} x^2}=\\frac{\\mathrm{d}\\left(\\frac{1}{t}\\right)}{\\mathrm{d} x}=\\frac{-\\frac{1}{t^2} \\mathrm{d} t}{\\frac{t}{1+t^2} \\mathrm{d} t}=-\\frac{1+t^2}{t^3}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"
          }
        ]
