            "id": "block-36-35-q",
            "type": "text",
            "content": "设 $y=y(x)$ 是由 $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}x=3 t^2+2 t+3 \\\\ e^y \\sin t-y+1=0\\end{array}\\right.$ 所确定. 则 $\\left.\\frac{\\mathrm{d}^2 y}{\\mathrm{~d} x^2}\\right|_{t=0}=[\\quad]$."
