            "id": "block-36-37-sol",
            "type": "text",
            "content": "$\\frac{\\mathrm{d} y}{\\mathrm{d} x}=\\frac{\\frac{\\mathrm{d} y}{\\mathrm{d} t}}{\\frac{\\mathrm{d} x}{\\mathrm{d} t}}=\\frac{a \\sin t}{a(1-\\cos t)}=\\frac{\\sin t}{1-\\cos t}=\\cot \\frac{t}{2}(t \\neq 2 n \\pi, n \\in \\mathbb{Z})$,\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}^2 y}{\\mathrm{d} x^2} & =\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d} t}\\left(\\cot \\frac{t}{2}\\right) \\cdot \\frac{\\mathrm{d} t}{\\mathrm{d} x}=-\\frac{1}{2 \\sin^2 \\frac{t}{2}} \\cdot \\frac{1}{a(1-\\cos t)} \\\\\n& =-\\frac{1}{a(1-\\cos t)^2}(t \\neq 2 n \\pi, n \\in \\mathbb{Z})\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"
