            "content": "解答 方程组两边同时对 $t$ 求导可得\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\frac{d x}{d t}=\\phi^{\\prime}(t), \\frac{d y}{d t}=f^{\\prime}(t), \\quad \\text { 可得 } \\frac{d y}{d x}=\\frac{d y / d t}{d x / d t}=\\frac{f^{\\prime}(t)}{\\phi^{\\prime}(t)} . \\\\\n& \\text { 即 } d y=\\frac{f^{\\prime}(t)}{\\phi^{\\prime}(t)} d x, \\quad d y=\\frac{f^{\\prime}(t)}{\\phi^{\\prime}(t)} d x=\\frac{f^{\\prime}(t)}{\\phi^{\\prime}(t)} d \\phi(t)=\\frac{f^{\\prime}(t)}{\\phi^{\\prime}(t)} \\phi^{\\prime}(t) d t=f^{\\prime}(t) d t\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"
