            "content": "解答 由极坐标方程可得参数方程组 $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}x=\\frac{\\cos \\theta}{\\cos \\theta+\\sin \\theta}=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\cos \\theta \\csc \\left(\\theta+\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right) \\\\ y=\\frac{\\sin \\theta}{\\cos \\theta+\\sin \\theta}=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\sin \\theta \\csc \\left(\\theta+\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)\\end{array}\\right.$ 两边同时对 $\\theta$ 求导可得\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\frac{d x}{d \\theta}=-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\sin \\theta \\csc \\left(\\theta+\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\cos \\theta \\csc \\left(\\theta+\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right) \\cot \\left(\\theta+\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right) \\\\\n& \\frac{d y}{d \\theta}=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\cos \\theta \\csc \\left(\\theta+\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\sin \\theta \\csc \\left(\\theta+\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right) \\cot \\left(\\theta+\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n可得 $\\frac{d y}{d x}=\\frac{d y / d \\theta}{d x / d \\theta}=-\\frac{\\cos \\theta-\\sin \\theta \\cot \\left(\\theta+\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)}{\\sin \\theta+\\cos \\theta \\cot \\left(\\theta+\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)}=-1$."
