            "id": "block-37-1-sol",
            "type": "text",
            "content": "解答 $y=(1-x)^n(1+x)^n$, 记 $u=(1+x)^n, v=(1-x)^n$,\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& u^{\\prime}=n(1+x)^{n-1}, \\quad u^{\\prime \\prime}=n(n-1)(1+x)^{n-2}, \\cdots \\\\\n& u^{(n-1)}=n \\cdot(n-1) \\cdots 2 \\cdot(1+x), \\quad u^{(n)}=n! \\\\\n& v^{\\prime}=-n(1-x)^{n-1}, \\quad v^{\\prime \\prime}=n(n-1)(1-x)^{n-2}, \\cdots \\\\\n& v^{(n-1)}=(-1)^{n-1} n \\cdot(n-1) \\cdots 2 \\cdot(1-x), \\quad v^{(n)}=(-1)^n n!,\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n利用莱布尼茨公式，有\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ny^{(n)} & =u^{(n)} v+C_n^1 u^{(n-1)} v^{\\prime}+\\cdots+u v^{(n)} \\\\\n& =n!(1-x)^n+n n!(x+1) \\cdot(-1) n(1-x)^{n-1}+\\cdots+(1+x)^n(-1)^n n! \\\\\n& =n!(1-x)^n-n^2 n!(x+1)(1-x)^{n-1}+\\cdots+(1+x)^n(-1)^n n! \\\\\n& =n!(1-x)^n\\left[1-n^2 \\frac{1+x}{1-x}+\\cdots+(-1)^n\\left(\\frac{1+x}{1-x}\\right)^n\\right]\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"
