            "content": "解答 由于\n$$\n\\left(3 x^2-2\\right)^{\\prime}=6 x,\\left(3 x^2-2\\right)^{\\prime \\prime}=6,\\left(3 x^2-2\\right)^{(n)}=0 \\quad(n \\geq 3)\n$$\n\n因此 Leibniz 公式中的和式中, 只有三项不为零, 故\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ny^{(100)} & =\\sum_{k=0}^{100} \\mathrm{C}_{100}^k(\\sin 2 x)^{(100-k)}\\left(3 x^2-2\\right)^{(k)} \\\\\n& =(\\sin 2 x)^{(100)}\\left(3 x^2-2\\right)+\\mathrm{C}_{100}^1(\\sin 2 x)^{(99)}\\left(3 x^2-2\\right)^{\\prime}+\\mathrm{C}_{100}^2(\\sin 2 x)^{(98)}\\left(3 x^2-2\\right)^{\\prime \\prime} \\\\\n& =2^{100} \\cdot\\left(3 x^2-2\\right) \\cdot \\sin 2 x-100 \\cdot 2^{99} \\cdot 6 x \\cdot \\cos 2 x-4950 \\cdot 2^{98} \\cdot 6 \\cdot \\sin 2 x \\\\\n& =2^{98}\\left[\\left(12 x^2-29708\\right) \\sin 2 x-1200 x \\cos 2 x\\right]\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"
