            "content": "解答 设 $f(x)=e^x, g(x)=x^2$, 则\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nf^{(k)}=e^x & (k=1,2, \\cdots, 18), \\\\\n& g^{\\prime}=2 x, g^{\\prime \\prime}=2, g^{\\prime \\prime \\prime}=0, g^{(k)}=0,(k=4, \\cdots, 18),\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n代入 Leibniz 公式, 得\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ny^{(18)} & =\\left(x^2 e^x\\right)^{(18)}=e^x \\cdot x^2+18 \\cdot e^x \\cdot 2 x+\\frac{18 \\cdot 17}{2!} \\cdot e^x \\cdot 2 \\\\\n& =x^2 e^x+36 x e^x+306 e^x=e^x\\left(x^2+36 x+306\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"
