            "id": "block-37-15-sol",
            "type": "text",
            "content": "解答 当 $n=1$ 时, $\\left(e^{-\\frac{1}{x}}\\right)^{\\prime}=\\frac{1}{x^2} e^{-\\frac{1}{x}}$.\n当 $n=2$ 时, $\\left(x e^{-\\frac{1}{x}}\\right)^{\\prime \\prime}=\\left(e^{-\\frac{1}{x}}+\\frac{1}{x} e^{-\\frac{1}{x}}\\right)^{\\prime}=\\frac{1}{x^3} e^{-\\frac{1}{x}}$.\n假设当 $n=k$ 时, 有 $y^{(k)}=\\frac{1}{x^{k+1}} e^{-\\frac{1}{x}}$ 结论成立, 则当 $n=k+1$ 时\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\left(x^k e^{-\\frac{1}{x}}\\right)^{(k+1)} & =\\left[\\left(x^k e^{-\\frac{1}{x}}\\right)^{\\prime}\\right]^{(k)} \\\\\n& =\\left(k x^{k-1} e^{-\\frac{1}{x}}+x^{k-2} e^{-\\frac{1}{x}}\\right)^{(k)} \\\\\n& =k \\frac{1}{x^{k+1}} e^{-\\frac{1}{x}}+\\left(\\left(x^{k-2} e^{-\\frac{1}{x}}\\right)^{(k-1)}\\right)^{\\prime} \\\\\n& =k \\frac{1}{x^{k+1}} e^{-\\frac{1}{x}}+\\left(\\frac{1}{x^k} e^{-\\frac{1}{x}}\\right)^{\\prime} \\\\\n& =k \\frac{1}{x^{k+1}} e^{-\\frac{1}{x}}-k \\frac{1}{x^{k+1}} e^{-\\frac{1}{x}}+\\frac{1}{x^{k+2}} e^{-\\frac{1}{x}}=\\frac{1}{x^{k+2}} e^{-\\frac{1}{x}}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n故当 $n=k+1$ 时, 结论成立."
