            "content": "解答 先求出题设函数在 $x=2$ 点处的 $\\Delta y$ 及则 $d y$ :\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\left.\\Delta y\\right|_{x=2}=\\left.\\left[(x+\\Delta x)^3-1-\\left(x^3-1\\right)\\right]\\right|_{x=2}=\\left.\\left[3 x^2 \\Delta x+3 x(\\Delta x)^2+(\\Delta x)^3\\right]\\right|_{x=2} \\\\\n& =12 \\Delta x+6(\\Delta x)^2+(\\Delta x)^3 \\\\\n& \\left.d y\\right|_{x=2}=\\left.\\left(y^{\\prime} d x\\right)\\right|_{x=2}=\\left.3 x^2 d x\\right|_{x=2}=12 d x=12 \\Delta x, \\\\\n& \\text { 当 } \\Delta x=2 \\text { 时, } \\Delta y=56, d y=24 ; \\\\\n& \\text { 当 } \\Delta x=1 \\text { 时, } \\Delta y=19, d y=12 ; \\\\\n& \\text { 当 } \\Delta x=0.1 \\text { 时, } \\Delta y=1.261, d y=1.2 ; \\\\\n& \\text { 当 } \\Delta x=0.01 \\text { 时, } \\Delta y=0.120601, d y=0.12 \\text {; }\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"
