            "content": "解答\n$$\n\\sqrt{a^2+x}=\\sqrt{a^2\\left(1+\\frac{x}{a^2}\\right)}=a\\left(1+\\frac{x}{a^2}\\right)^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\approx a\\left(1+\\frac{x}{2 a^2}\\right)=a+\\frac{x}{2 a}\n$$"
