            "content": "解答\n由 $V=\\frac{1}{6} \\pi D^3, d V=\\frac{\\pi}{2} D^2 \\Delta D$, 可得\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\left|\\frac{d V}{V}\\right|=\\left|\\frac{\\frac{\\pi}{2} D^2 \\Delta D}{\\frac{1}{6} \\pi D^3}\\right|=3\\left|\\frac{\\Delta D}{D}\\right| \\leq 2 \\%, \\\\\n& \\left|\\frac{\\Delta D}{D}\\right| \\leq \\frac{2}{3} \\%=0.667 \\%\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"
