            "type": "text",
            "content": "设 $l=x(t), w=y(t)$，则对角线 $s(t)=\\sqrt{x^2(t)+y^2(t)}$。由题意可知初值为 $x(t_0)=12 \\mathrm{~cm}, y(t_0)=5 \\mathrm{~cm}, x'(t_0)=2, y'(t_0)=3$，即 $\\left.s'(t)\\right|_{t=t_0}=\\left.\\frac{x(t) x'(t)+y(t) y'(t)}{\\sqrt{x^2(t)+y^2(t)}}\\right|_{t=t_0}=3$。"
