          {
            "id": "block-51-28-sol",
            "type": "text",
            "content": "$\\begin{aligned} & f^{\\prime}(x)=10 x+1, \\\\ & f(x+\\Delta x)-f(x)=5(x+\\Delta x)^2+(x+\\Delta x)+12-(5x^2+x+12) \\\\ & =10x\\Delta x + 5(\\Delta x)^2 + \\Delta x = \\Delta x(10x+5\\Delta x+1). \\\\ & \\text{又 } \\Delta x f^{\\prime}(x+\\theta \\Delta x) = \\Delta x [10(x+\\theta \\Delta x)+1] = \\Delta x(10x+10\\theta\\Delta x+1). \\\\ & \\text{由此可得 } 5\\Delta x = 10\\theta\\Delta x, \\text{ 解得 } \\theta=\\frac{1}{2}. \\end{aligned}$"
          }
