          "$2+\\frac{1}{4}(x-4)+\\frac{1}{64}(x-4)^2+\\frac{1}{512}(x-4)^3+\\frac{15}{4!\\cdot 16 \\xi^{7/2}}(x-4)^4$, $\\xi$ 介于 $x$ 与 $4$ 之间;",
          "$2+\\frac{1}{4}(x-4)-\\frac{1}{64}(x-4)^2+\\frac{1}{512}(x-4)^3-\\frac{15}{4!\\cdot 16 \\xi^{7/2}}(x-4)^4$, $\\xi$ 介于 $x$ 与 $4$ 之间;",
          "$2+\\frac{1}{4}(x-4)-\\frac{1}{64}(x-4)^2+\\frac{1}{512}(x-4)^3-\\frac{15}{4!\\cdot 16 \\xi^{5/2}}(x-4)^4$, $\\xi$ 介于 $x$ 与 $4$ 之间."
