            "id": "block-54-10-sol",
            "type": "text",
            "content": "因为 $f^{\\prime}(x)=\\frac{1}{2} x^{-\\frac{1}{2}}, f^{\\prime \\prime}(x)=-\\frac{1}{4} x^{-\\frac{3}{2}}, f^{\\prime \\prime \\prime}(x)=\\frac{3}{8} x^{-\\frac{5}{2}}, f^{(4)}(x)=-\\frac{15}{16} x^{-\\frac{7}{2}}$, 则三阶 Taylor 公式为\n$$\n2+\\frac{1}{4}(x-4)-\\frac{1}{64}(x-4)^2+\\frac{1}{512}(x-4)^3-\\frac{15}{4!\\cdot 16 \\xi^{7 / 2}}(x-4)^4, \\xi \\text { 介于 } x \\text { 与 } 4 \\text { 之间. }\n$$"
