            "content": "$\\begin{aligned} & \\lim _{x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{1-x^2-e^{-x^2}}{x \\sin ^3 2 x}=\\lim _{x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{1-x^2-e^{-x^2}}{8 x^4} \\\\ = & \\lim _{x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{1-x^2-\\left(1-x^2+\\frac{x^4}{2}+o\\left(x^4\\right)\\right)}{8 x^4}=\\lim _{x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{-\\frac{x^4}{2}+o\\left(x^4\\right)}{8 x^4}=-\\frac{1}{16} .\\end{aligned}$"
