            "content": "$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& f(x)=x-a \\sin x-\\frac{b}{2} \\sin 2 x \\\\\n= & x-a\\left(x-\\frac{x^3}{3!}+\\frac{x^5}{5!}+o\\left(x^5\\right)\\right)-\\frac{b}{2}\\left(2 x-\\frac{(2 x)^3}{3!}+\\frac{(2 x)^5}{5!}+o\\left(x^5\\right)\\right) \\\\\n= & (1-a-b) x+\\left(\\frac{a}{6}+\\frac{2 b}{3}\\right) x^3-\\left(\\frac{a}{120}+\\frac{2 b}{15}\\right) x^5+o\\left(x^5\\right) .\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}\n1-a-b=0, \\\\\n\\frac{a}{6}+\\frac{2 b}{3}=0, \\quad a=\\frac{4}{3}, b=-\\frac{1}{3} . \\\\\n\\frac{a}{120}+\\frac{2 b}{15} \\neq 0 .\n\\end{array}\\right.\n$$"
