            "id": "block-56-16-sol",
            "type": "text",
            "content": "$\\begin{aligned} & \\cos \\left(x e^x\\right)=1-\\frac{1}{2!}\\left(x e^x\\right)^2+\\frac{1}{4!}\\left(x e^x\\right)^4+o\\left(\\left(x e^x\\right)^5\\right)=1-\\frac{1}{2} x^2 e^{2 x}+\\frac{1}{24} x^4 e^{4 x}+o\\left(x^5\\right) \\\\ &= 1-\\frac{1}{2} x^2\\left(1+2 x+\\frac{1}{2!}(2 x)^2+\\frac{1}{3!}(2 x)^3+o\\left(x^3\\right)\\right)+\\frac{1}{24} x^4\\left(1+4 x+o\\left(x^2\\right)\\right)+o\\left(x^5\\right) \\\\ &= 1-\\frac{1}{2} x^2-x^3-\\frac{23}{24} x^4-\\frac{1}{2} x^5+o\\left(x^5\\right) \\\\ & \\cos \\left(x e^{-x}\\right)=\\cos \\left(-x e^{-x}\\right)=1-\\frac{1}{2}(-x)^2-(-x)^3-\\frac{23}{24}(-x)^4-\\frac{1}{2}(-x)^5+o\\left(x^5\\right) \\\\ &= 1-\\frac{1}{2} x^2+x^3-\\frac{23}{24} x^4+\\frac{1}{2} x^5+o\\left(x^5\\right), \\\\ & \\lim _{x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{\\cos \\left(x e^x\\right)-\\cos \\left(x e^{-x}\\right)+2 x^3}{\\ln ^5(1+x)}=\\lim _{x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{\\cos \\left(x e^x\\right)-\\cos \\left(x e^{-x}\\right)+2 x^3}{x^5}=\\lim _{x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{-x^5+o\\left(x^5\\right)}{x^5}=-1 .\\end{aligned}$"
