            "content": "$\\begin{aligned} & \\lim _{x \\rightarrow \\infty} x^2\\left(1-x \\sin \\frac{1}{x}\\right)=\\lim _{x \\rightarrow \\infty} \\frac{1-x \\sin \\frac{1}{x}}{\\frac{1}{x^2}}=\\lim _{t \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{1-\\frac{1}{t} \\sin t}{t^2} \\\\ & =\\lim _{t \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{t-\\sin t}{t^3}=\\lim _{t \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{1-\\cos t}{3 t^2}=\\frac{1}{6}\\end{aligned}$"
